Build the API with Express (TypeScript on Node.js 24) and the frontend with React (TypeScript, built with Vite). The backend serves the API and the frontend build. Store data in PostgreSQL: the connection URL is in the environment variable `DATABASE_URL`.
The backend lives in `backend/` (entry `backend/src/server.ts`, run directly by Node.js 24, dependencies in `backend/package.json`). The frontend is a Vite project in `frontend/`; `npm run build` writes `frontend/dist`.
